2026-10-28T17:39:09.0041338Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LyGL3BLWSVFduLSiFU5iTk","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"number\": 25,\n3\t  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/25\",\n4\t  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n5\t  \"title\": \"aws_savingsplans_savings_plan fails after creating No Upfront plan because upfront_payment_amount changes from null to \\\"0.00000000\\\"\",\n6\t  \"body\": \"### Terraform and AWS Provider Version\\n\\n```console\\n`hashicorp/aws v6.42.0`\\n```\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\n`aws_savingsplans_savings_plan`\\n\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\nIf the user creates a no-upfront savings plan, it should successfully apply and produce a consistent result.\\n\\n### Actual Behavior\\n\\nCreating a no-upfront savings plan produces an output of \\\"upfront_payment_amount  = 0.00000000\\\" after create, which causes Terraform to treat the resource as tainted.\\n\\n\\n### Relevant Error/Panic Output\\n\\n```console\\n\\n```\\n\\n\\n### Sample Terraform Configuration\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand configuration</summary>\\n\\n```hcl\\nvariable \\\"target_region\\\" {\\n  type    = string\\n  default = \\\"us-west-2\\\"\\n}\\n\\ndata \\\"aws_savingsplans_offerings\\\" \\\"repro\\\" {\\n  product_type    = \\\"EC2\\\"\\n  plan_types      = [\\\"EC2Instance\\\"]\\n  payment_options = [\\\"No Upfront\\\"]\\n  durations       = [31536000]\\n  currencies      = [\\\"USD\\\"]\\n\\n  filter {\\n    name   = \\\"region\\\"\\n    values = [var.target_region]\\n  }\\n\\n  filter {\\n    name   = \\\"instanceFamily\\\"\\n    values = [\\\"g4dn\\\"]\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nresource \\\"aws_savingsplans_savings_plan\\\" \\\"repro\\\" {\\n  savings_plan_offering_id = one(data.aws_savingsplans_offerings.repro.offerings[*].offering_id)\\n\\n  # Already padded, so this isolates the upfront_payment_amount issue.\\n  commitment = \\\"0.92900000\\\"\\n\\n  lifecycle {\\n    prevent_destroy = true\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### Steps to Reproduce\\n\\n```\\nterraform init\\nterraform plan\\nterraform apply\\n```\\n\\n### Debug Logging\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand log output</summary>\\n\\n```console\\nProvider produced inconsistent result after apply\\n\\n.upfront_payment_amount: was null, but now cty.StringVal(\\\"0.00000000\\\")\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### GenAI / LLM Assisted Development\\n\\nOpenAI Codex\\n\\n### Important Facts and References\\n\\n_No response_\\n\\n### Would you like to implement a fix?\\n\\nNo\\n\",\n7\t  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n8\t  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n9\t  \"labels\": [\n10\t    \"bug\"\n11\t  ],\n12\t  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:09:11Z\",\n13\t  \"as_of\": \"2026-06-12T20:06:03Z\"\n14\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b75b5a28-6b87-46ba-9f74-163207ec4e6f","uuid":"be3e28b1-27fa-4aa6-8322-0e024f4f0867","timestamp":"2026-10-28T17:39:08.995Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/gh-aw/agent/issue.json","content":"{\n  \"number\": 25,\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent/issues/25\",\n  \"repo\": \"wzinl/cs467-as3-triage-agent\",\n  \"title\": \"aws_savingsplans_savings_plan fails after creating No Upfront plan because upfront_payment_amount changes from null to \\\"0.00000000\\\"\",\n  \"body\": \"### Terraform and AWS Provider Version\\n\\n```console\\n`hashicorp/aws v6.42.0`\\n```\\n\\n### Affected Resource(s) or Data Source(s)\\n\\n`aws_savingsplans_savings_plan`\\n\\n\\n### Expected Behavior\\n\\nIf the user creates a no-upfront savings plan, it should successfully apply and produce a consistent result.\\n\\n### Actual Behavior\\n\\nCreating a no-upfront savings plan produces an output of \\\"upfront_payment_amount  = 0.00000000\\\" after create, which causes Terraform to treat the resource as tainted.\\n\\n\\n### Relevant Error/Panic Output\\n\\n```console\\n\\n```\\n\\n\\n### Sample Terraform Configuration\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand configuration</summary>\\n\\n```hcl\\nvariable \\\"target_region\\\" {\\n  type    = string\\n  default = \\\"us-west-2\\\"\\n}\\n\\ndata \\\"aws_savingsplans_offerings\\\" \\\"repro\\\" {\\n  product_type    = \\\"EC2\\\"\\n  plan_types      = [\\\"EC2Instance\\\"]\\n  payment_options = [\\\"No Upfront\\\"]\\n  durations       = [31536000]\\n  currencies      = [\\\"USD\\\"]\\n\\n  filter {\\n    name   = \\\"region\\\"\\n    values = [var.target_region]\\n  }\\n\\n  filter {\\n    name   = \\\"instanceFamily\\\"\\n    values = [\\\"g4dn\\\"]\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nresource \\\"aws_savingsplans_savings_plan\\\" \\\"repro\\\" {\\n  savings_plan_offering_id = one(data.aws_savingsplans_offerings.repro.offerings[*].offering_id)\\n\\n  # Already padded, so this isolates the upfront_payment_amount issue.\\n  commitment = \\\"0.92900000\\\"\\n\\n  lifecycle {\\n    prevent_destroy = true\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### Steps to Reproduce\\n\\n```\\nterraform init\\nterraform plan\\nterraform apply\\n```\\n\\n### Debug Logging\\n\\n<details open>\\n<summary>Click to expand log output</summary>\\n\\n```console\\nProvider produced inconsistent result after apply\\n\\n.upfront_payment_amount: was null, but now cty.StringVal(\\\"0.00000000\\\")\\n```\\n</details>\\n\\n\\n### GenAI / LLM Assisted Development\\n\\nOpenAI Codex\\n\\n### Important Facts and References\\n\\n_No response_\\n\\n### Would you like to implement a fix?\\n\\nNo\\n\",\n  \"author\": \"zzzinn\",\n  \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"bug\"\n  ],\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T17:09:11Z\",\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-06-12T20:06:03Z\"\n}","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LyGL3BLWSVFduLSiFU5iTk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
